%% title: AnaCredit Report Lifecycle — from exposure registration to return rendering
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ExposurePending : POST /api/v1/anacredit/exposures\n(operator / upstream feed)

    ExposurePending --> ExposureRegistered : upsert accepted\n(instrumentId stored in InMemoryCreditExposureRepository)

    ExposureRegistered --> ExposureRegistered : re-registered\n(idempotent upsert — same instrumentId replaces previous)

    ExposureRegistered --> ReturnRequested : GET /api/v1/anacredit/returns/{referenceDate}\n(operator / auditor triggers render)

    state ReturnRequested {
        [*] --> AggregatingDebtorTotals : listAll() from repository
        AggregatingDebtorTotals --> AssessingEligibility : per-debtor totalCommittedAmountEur computed

        state AssessingEligibility {
            [*] --> EvaluatingScope
            EvaluatingScope --> ExcludedHousehold : debtorType == NATURAL_PERSON\nreason: HOUSEHOLD_OUT_OF_SCOPE
            EvaluatingScope --> EvaluatingMateriality : debtorType == LEGAL_ENTITY

            EvaluatingMateriality --> ExcludedBelowThreshold : totalCommittedAmountEur < €25 000\nreason: BELOW_THRESHOLD
            EvaluatingMateriality --> EvaluatingExposure : totalCommittedAmountEur >= €25 000

            EvaluatingExposure --> ExcludedNoExposure : committedAmountEur == 0\nAND drawnAmount == 0\nreason: NO_EXPOSURE
            EvaluatingExposure --> Reportable : has commitment or drawing
        }

        Reportable --> MappedToCreditRecord : AnaCreditReturnBuilder maps\noutstandingNominalAmount = drawnAmount\noffBalanceSheetAmount = max(committed−drawn, 0)
        ExcludedHousehold --> MappedToExclusionNote : ExclusionNote recorded\n(audit trail — nothing disappears silently)
        ExcludedBelowThreshold --> MappedToExclusionNote
        ExcludedNoExposure --> MappedToExclusionNote

        MappedToCreditRecord --> ReturnBuilt
        MappedToExclusionNote --> ReturnBuilt
        ReturnBuilt --> [*]
    }

    ReturnRequested --> ReturnRendered : AnaCreditReturn { creditRecords, exclusionNotes }

    ReturnRendered --> [*] : 200 OK — operator exports\nto ČNB/ECB manually (v1)\nSDMX transport is out of scope
